[en.FOCUS_C18_110_OPEN_TO_DRAGONS]
Friendship with Dragons

[en.FOCUS_C18_110_OPEN_TO_DRAGONS_desc]
The northern dragons are our old friends, but now they are troubled by the centaurs. We want to help them, but at the same time we do not want to be noticed by the centaurs...

[zh.FOCUS_C18_110_OPEN_TO_DRAGONS]
与龙族的友谊

[zh.FOCUS_C18_110_OPEN_TO_DRAGONS_desc]
北方的龙族是我们的老朋友了，但如今他们受到半人马的困扰。我们希望可以帮助他们，但同时并不希望被半人马注意...

